SUMMARY:Collective Measures
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Collective Measures is a Boston-based\, semi-professional\, all
  gender a cappella group working tirelessly to add their own flavor to the
  thriving local a cappella scene. They pride themselves on creating challe
 nging arrangements of music ranging from Jukebox the Ghost\, to the Steely
  Dan\, to Maroon 5. They have a weakness for killer mashups\, and you can 
 be sure to hear a few when you catch them performing at different venues a
 round Massachusetts. Made up of 13 members with a variety of day jobs—an
 d even more diverse hobbies—the group is united by their love of making 
 music. Collective Measures is a founding member of the Contemporary A Capp
 ella League (CAL).\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?
 evt=1345\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1345
END:VEVENT
