 above the Lilypad in 2006\, just a few blocks from where his grandfather g
 rew up on Inman st. At the time Jesse was in the middle of what would be a
 bout a decade of regular touring\, performing & recording with his psyched
 elic rock band Apollo Sunshine. The band was featured in the New York Time
 s\, Rolling Stone\, Spin & shared the stage with legendary acts Wu-Tang Cl
 an\, Toots & The Maytals\, The Flaming Lips & Dr. Dog. Jesse has been invo
 lved with the Lilypad for 20 years and the full time talent booking agent 
 since 2013.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026/jesse-gallagher-steve-
 fell-l4sd9-l9hcp-9x5ym-9cxt7-37jb4-62el8-8ftnb-xsaw3\nFrom Pushpin Boston:
