SUMMARY:Hilary Hawke Band\, Stash Wyslouch
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The Hilary Hawke Band is a fun\, powerhouse quartet featuring g
 uitarist Ross Martin (Jacob Joliff Band\, Matt Flinner Trio)\, fiddler Cam
 ille Howes\, and bassist Myles Sloniker (Jacob Joliff Band) based out of N
 YC. Since forming as a trio in 2022\, the group has built its identity aro
 und improvisation\, original songwriting\, and a shared love of bluegrass 
 and old-time traditions. Hilary and Ross bring over 15 years of shared mus
 ical history across a range of bluegrass projects while also stretching in
 to the world of original music. The band leans into songwriting and improv
 isation\, with performances that are vibrant and engaging. Expect banjo dr
 ive\, soaring fiddle melodies\, intricate guitar work\, tasteful bass line
 s\, rich harmonies\, all grounded in songs that celebrate creativity\, and
  the joy of being live in a room with an audience.\nhttps://tickets.24hour
 music.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1928\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pus
 hpin.city/boston/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1928
END:VEVENT
