DESCRIPTION:The Slutcracker Tickets on sale Friday\, October 2 at Noon. The
  Slutcracker is a beacon of joy that sparked worldwide interest upon its s
 candalous debut. It is beautiful. It is bawdy. But…no children\, please
 —our parody of The Nutcracker transports the audience into a grown-up re
 telling of a holiday classic. Personality and diversity. Sequins and glitt
 er….\nhttps://www.somervilletheatre.com/production/the-slutcracker/\nFro
