DTSTART:20261205T180000Z
DTEND:20261205T200000Z
SUMMARY:Jay Bragg Presents: Christmas in New Vaudeville
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:From Nashville\, Jay Bragg's beloved "Christmas in New Vaudevil
 le" returns to The Burren in Somerville\, MA bringing The Merriest Show On
  Earth — now in its 6th annual year — to his home base of New England.
  Jay\, whose grandparents performed in 1930s vaudeville\, transforms into 
 bandleader King Kazoo from the North Pole\, adorned in his signature brigh
 t red frock coat\, top hat\, brass kazoo\, and a dose of whimsy that only 
 the Wizard of Whimsy can muster — leading The Reindeer Band through a jo
 yful\, theatrical night of original and holiday music built for the whole 
 family. Equal parts vaudeville throwback and Christmas spectacle\, this is
  a holiday show like you've never experienced and will never forget.\nhttp
 s://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1460\nFrom Pushpin B
 oston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1460
END:VEVENT
