SUMMARY:The Sweetback Sisters - XMAS Sing Along Spectacular
LOCATION:Crystal Ballroom\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating 20 Years! Every family has its Christmas traditions
 . The cookies. The tree. The ornament that's been hanging on by a thread s
 ince 1987. For thousands of people across the country\, The Sweetback Sist
 ers' Country Christmas Sing-Along Spectacular has become one of them. For 
 twenty years\, audiences have gathered for an evening that feels less like
  a concert and more like the Christmas party everyone wishes they'd been i
 nvited to. One part country music revue\, one part vintage holiday variety
  show\, and one part joyful audience sing-along\, the Spectacular is fille
 d with classic carols\, country Christmas favorites\, forgotten seasonal g
 ems\, quirky originals\, surprisingly consequential holiday trivia\, impro
 bable prizes\, and enough laughter to keep winter at bay.\nhttps://www.tic
 ketmaster.com/the-sweetback-sisters-xmas-sing-along-somerville-massachuset
 ts-12-19-2026/event/01006548281C5DE1\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin
 .city/boston/
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-sweetback-sisters-xmas-sing-along-some
 rville-massachusetts-12-19-2026/event/01006548281C5DE1
